---
layout: base.njk
title: Contact
description: Get in touch with Disco Carrot. Reach out about events, sponsorship, or just say hello.
permalink: /contact/
---
<style>
  .contact-hero {
    padding: 160px 48px 40px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .contact-hero .eyebrow {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--orange); margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .contact-hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .contact-hero p {
    font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--muted); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .contact-body {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 48px 100px;
  }
  .contact-form {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px;
  }
  .form-group {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;
  }
  .form-group label {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .form-group input,
  .form-group textarea {
    background: var(--deep);
    border: 1px solid var(--slate);
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    color: var(--ice);
    font-family: 'Lexend', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
    outline: none;
  }
  .form-group input:focus,
  .form-group textarea:focus {
    border-color: var(--orange);
  }
  .form-group input::placeholder,
  .form-group textarea::placeholder {
    color: var(--muted); opacity: 0.5;
  }
  .form-group textarea {
    min-height: 150px; resize: vertical;
  }
  .form-submit {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--midnight); background: var(--orange);
    padding: 16px 36px; border-radius: 2px;
    border: none; cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }
  .form-submit:hover { background: var(--gold); transform: translateY(-3px); }

  .or-divider {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 48px 0;
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px;
  }
  .or-divider::before,
  .or-divider::after {
    content: '';
    flex: 1; height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(--slate), transparent);
  }
  .cal-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cal-cta p {
    font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ice); margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .cal-link {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--midnight); background: var(--orange);
    padding: 16px 36px; border-radius: 2px;
    text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }
  .cal-link:hover { background: var(--gold); transform: translateY(-3px); }

  .social-links {
    text-align: center; padding: 0 48px 80px;
  }
  .social-links a {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--orange); text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,92,0,0.3);
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
    margin: 0 16px;
  }
  .social-links a:hover { border-color: var(--orange); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .contact-hero { padding: 120px 24px 40px; }
    .contact-body { padding: 20px 24px 80px; }
    .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .form-submit { align-self: stretch; }
    .social-links { padding: 0 24px 60px; }
  }
</style>

<div class="contact-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Get in Touch</p>
  <h1>Contact Us</h1>
  <p>We're looking for athletes, brands, and individuals that value adventure and making an impact. There are a number of ways you can be a part of this project. Please reach out and let's make some tracks on the mountains.</p>
</div>

<div class="contact-body">
  <form class="contact-form" name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
    <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">
    <p style="display:none;"><label>Don't fill this out: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="first-name">First Name *</label>
        <input type="text" id="first-name" name="first-name" required placeholder="First name">
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="last-name">Last Name *</label>
        <input type="text" id="last-name" name="last-name" required placeholder="Last name">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="email">Email *</label>
      <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@example.com">
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="message">Message *</label>
      <textarea id="message" name="message" required placeholder="Tell us what you're thinking..."></textarea>
    </div>

    <button type="submit" class="form-submit">Send Message →</button>
  </form>

  <div class="or-divider">Or</div>

  <div class="cal-cta">
    <p>Schedule a time to talk.</p>
    <a href="https://cal.com/disco-carrot/general-inquiry" class="cal-link" data-cal-link="disco-carrot/general-inquiry" data-cal-namespace="general" data-cal-config='{"layout":"month_view","theme":"dark"}'>Book a Call →</a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="social-links">
  <a href="https://www.instagram.com/discocarrotsnowcat/" target="_blank">Instagram →</a>
  <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61576695981616" target="_blank">Facebook →</a>
</div>
